## Your Task
Based on the book analysis provided, generate a comprehensive styleguide that includes:
1. Exact HTML templates for each section type
2. Precise Tailwind CSS classes (no variations allowed)
3. Clear rules to prevent any inconsistency

## Critical Requirements

### CONSISTENCY IS PARAMOUNT
- Every section of the same type MUST use the EXACT same HTML structure
- No creative variations - use the templates exactly as specified
- All padding, margins, colors, and typography must match exactly

### FORBIDDEN ELEMENTS (NEVER USE)
- NO gradient backgrounds (`bg-gradient-*`)
- NO blur effects (`blur-*`)
- NO decorative shapes or circles
- NO `absolute` positioned decorative elements
- NO decorative dividers or separators
- NO `aria-hidden="true"` decorative elements
- NO colored container backgrounds (keep `bg-white`)
- NO shadow effects except `shadow-sm` on images

### TEXT RULES
- Each data-id must appear EXACTLY ONCE
- Never duplicate or modify text content
- Only use `<h1>` for text with type `section_heading`
- All other text types use `<p>`

## Output Format
Generate the styleguide as Markdown with exact HTML code blocks for each section type.
